==Dutch==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|nl|dum|richten}}, from {{inh|nl|odt|rihten}}, from {{inh|nl|gem-pro|*rihtijaną||to right}}, derived from {{m|gem-pro|*rehtaz||right, straight}} (modern {{m|nl|recht}}).

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|nl|/ˈrɪxtə(n)/}}
* {{audio|nl|Nl-richten.ogg|audio}}
* {{rhymes|nl|ɪxtən|s=2}}

===Verb===
{{nl-verb}}

# {{lb|nl|transitive}} to [[direct]], [[aim]]

====Inflection====
{{nl-conj-wk|richt}}

====Derived terms====
* {{l|nl|richting}}
* {{l|nl|aanrichten}}
* {{l|nl|africhten}}
* {{l|nl|berichten}}
* {{l|nl|gelijkrichten}}
* {{l|nl|inrichten}}
* {{l|nl|oprichten}}
* {{l|nl|uitrichten}}
* {{l|nl|verrichten}}

